# Build context is the repository root, which also holds data/ and model
# runs (many GB). Send only the two packages the image needs.
#
# BuildKit (the default builder since Docker 23) reads this file because it
# sits next to the Dockerfile and is named after it.
*
!segment_mandible
!super_resolution

**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.DS_Store
**/._*
segment_mandible/tests
super_resolution/.env
